> One block. Inject it **immediately after `st.set_page_config(...)`** at line 272 and before
> anything else renders, or the first paint flashes unstyled. Assign it to a module constant
> `REPORT_CSS` and call `st.markdown(REPORT_CSS, unsafe_allow_html=True)`.
>
> Every selector below targets a stable `data-testid` or a `.stX` class name (Streamlit mirrors
> testids into class names). **No hashed `.st-emotion-cache-*` selectors are used**, because those
> change between patch releases and would silently un-style the app on any upgrade. If a selector
> ever stops biting, verify with: open the app, F12, and check the element's `data-testid`.

```python
REPORT_CSS = """
<style>
/* ==========================================================================
   SIH26166 - Lunar Image Registration
   Report skin. One block. Injected once, immediately after set_page_config().
   Ground: paper. Voices: serif = document, sans = apparatus, mono = measured.
   Rules, never boxes. No radius, no shadow, no gradient anywhere.
   ========================================================================== */

/* --- 1. tokens ---------------------------------------------------------- */
:root{
  /* paper */
  --paper:      #FAF8F3;   /* page ground; deliberately not #FFF - see notes */
  --paper-2:    #F3F0E8;   /* sidebar */
  --paper-3:    #E8E4D8;   /* inset: table head, code, principal-result band */

  /* ink */
  --ink:        #1A1A18;   /* body            16.9:1 on paper */
  --ink-2:      #3D3A34;   /* headings' hairline, secondary */
  --ink-3:      #5F5A50;   /* captions, notes  6.5:1 on paper - AA at 14px */

  /* rules */
  --rule:       #CFC9BA;   /* hairline */
  --rule-mid:   #A8A192;   /* figure frames */
  --rule-strong:#8C8578;   /* section rule, masthead */

  /* accents */
  --accent:     #1D3B5C;   /* ink blue: links, primary button   10.8:1 */
  --alarm:      #8C1D18;   /* oxblood: FAIL, contradiction       8.6:1 */

  /* reliability states - luminance-ordered so greyscale still separates them */
  --st-verified:#1F5130;   /* 8.6:1 */
  --st-weak:    #8A4B10;   /* 6.3:1 */
  --st-none:    #6E6A61;   /* 5.2:1 */

  /* families - all three ship with Windows 11; nothing is fetched */
  --serif: Georgia, Cambria, "Palatino Linotype", "Times New Roman", serif;
  --sans:  "Segoe UI", "Segoe UI Variable Text", Candara, Corbel, Calibri,
           system-ui, sans-serif;
  --mono:  Consolas, "Cascadia Mono", "Lucida Console", "Courier New", monospace;

  /* spacing scale - 4px grid, doubling. Use these; do not invent values. */
  --s1:4px; --s2:8px;  --s3:12px; --s4:16px; --s5:24px;
  --s6:32px; --s7:48px; --s8:64px; --s9:96px;

  --measure: 68ch;         /* prose column. 62ch if you raise baseFontSize */
  --page:    1180px;       /* text block width inside the wide layout */
}

/* --- 2. strip the Streamlit chrome -------------------------------------- */
#stDecoration{display:none!important;}          /* the rainbow gradient bar */
[data-testid="stAppDeployButton"]{display:none!important;}
#MainMenu{visibility:hidden;}
[data-testid="stHeader"]{background:transparent;height:0;}
footer{display:none;}

/* --- 3. the page -------------------------------------------------------- */
html, body, .stApp{
  background:var(--paper);
  color:var(--ink);
  font-family:var(--serif);
  font-size:17px;
  line-height:1.55;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
[data-testid="stMainBlockContainer"], .stMainBlockContainer, .block-container{
  max-width:var(--page);
